### 第二阶段完整演示顺序
# 1. 登录并设置 @token
# 2. GET /api/v1/map/communities
# 3. PUT /api/v1/communities/{communityId}/location
# 4. POST /api/v1/inspection-tasks
# 5. POST /api/v1/inspection-tasks/{taskId}/start
# 6. POST /api/v1/inspection-records
# 7. POST /api/v1/assets/images
# 8. POST /api/v1/inspection-tasks/{taskId}/complete
